                        "glosses": [
                            "An analogue precursor to the fax machine, transmitting electrical impulses recorded by potentiometers to servomechanisms attached to a pen at the receiving station, thus reproducing a drawing or signature made by the sender."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "historical"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
