                                "sense_id": "e8903992-f661-34b8-bf38-7ee1676ef5ce",
                                "text": "On Tuesday, March 21, was made the first public test of the telautograph, a long distance writing machine, the invention of Professor Elisha Gray of Chicago, which practically solves the problem of autographic communication over miles of wire."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
